WEBVTT

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:04.980
Satoshi, who dreams of
becoming a Pokémon Master...

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.530
And Go, who aims to
catch every Pokémon.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.240
What kind of Pokémon
will they meet today?

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.250
Whoa! Big news!

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.530
What?

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.210
It's Houou! Houou appeared!

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.130
What?!

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.190
I see... There were
Houou sightings, huh?

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.130
Yeah!

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.510
People were talking about it online!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:37.760
Houou is deeply connected with
the ancient folklore of the Johto Region.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.770
I know! And it's supposed to be
really hard to find!

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:45.440
Yeah. Very few records of it remain.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.260
It's a Legendary Pokémon
shrouded in mystery.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.530
And that legend has
finally shown itself!

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:59.530
The sightings were all reported
around Enju City in Johto.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:03.540
If we go there,
we can meet Houou...

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:08.100
I've always wanted to
battle Houou someday!

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:08.770
What?

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:10.280
I wanna catch it!

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.050
What?!

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.300
You two really are interesting!

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.810
Even when dealing with a Legendary Pokémon,
you talk about battling and catching it!

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.870
Go, let's head straight for Enju City!

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:23.920
Yeah!

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.520
Let's go!

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.700
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.280
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.990
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:43.870
And skip the slow send-off

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.210
Be it through fire or through water

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.880
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.380
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:58.640
Each and every one of my memories

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:03.220
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.140
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:12.900
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:19.910
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:24.120
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.450
Let's have a fight!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.160
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.000
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.340
On 3, let's be friends!

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:41.010
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:46.350
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.850
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:52.980
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.770
I choose you!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:03.780
The Johto Region's Legend of Houou!!
The Vow From That Day!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.790
Enju City, Johto Region

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:15.300
We're here!

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:17.020
Enju City!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.590
All right! Let's find Houou!

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:28.340
Satoshi! It looks like Bell Tower
had the most sightings!

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:31.150
Knew I could count on you!
Just you wait, Houou!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.990
I was looking into it, and Houou had
a peculiar legend about it...

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:57.350
Otachi! Scout Pokémon!
Normal type!

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:01.960
It stands on its tail
so it can see a long way!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.350
All right, I'll catch it!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.310
Monster Ball, go!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.690
Otachi's data will be
added to the Index!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.950
Got it!

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:25.740
Go... Isn't finding Houou
more important?

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.450
That's...

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.600
Houou!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.730
I can't believe we
found it so quickly!

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.090
Pikachu!
Use 100,000 Volts!

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.760
It was that easy?

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.370
Are you all right?

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.080
An Onidrill and a Hinoarashi?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.750
That explains why it was so easy.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.370
How could you do that?!

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:21.290
Sorry! I thought it was Houou.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.170
Don't tell me the Houou sightings were...

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.640
Um... Well...

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.070
Kurio!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.070
Grandpa...

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.630
I thought as much.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:47.280
You seeing Houou the other day
was a lie, too, I suppose?

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:52.290
I told you, Houou doesn't exist.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:56.750
It does exist!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.710
Houou does exist!

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:06.180
You must have been tricked
by Kurio's fake, too.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.840
That's not it!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.530
On the day I set out
to become a Pokémon Master,

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.030
I saw it with my own eyes!

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.250
You just <i>thought</i> you did,
didn't you?

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.000
Grandpa...

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.890
That's what he says now,

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:52.670
but Grandpa used to say
he'd met Houou.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.440
Look at this, Kurio!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.940
This is Houou's
Rainbow Feather!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:12.170
Legend has it that happiness will come to
whoever holds this feather!

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:15.830
That's incredible, Grandpa!
You met Houou?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:21.830
I did. Though back then, the clouds were in the way,
so I couldn't get a good look at it.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.680
Next time,
I want to see it up close!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:31.840
He kept going on journeys
to try and find Houou...

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:35.850
But one day,
he came back all of a sudden...

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:40.630
He was completely down,
having no interest in finding Houou anymore...

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:46.610
Um, Grandpa? Aren't you going
to look for Houou?

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.620
There is no Houou.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:08:03.240
No matter how hard I looked,
it would never show itself to me.

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:07.220
It never existed in the first place.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.280
That's how legends are.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.140
I'm tired of chasing dreams.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.650
I can't believe this thing
tricked me for so long...

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:34.980
And that's why I...

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:43.170
...want Grandpa to look
for Houou again, and to cheer up.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:48.410
That's why you had Onidrill and Hinoarashi
pretend to be Houou?

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:50.670
But isn't that lying to him?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.680
I guess it is...

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:59.090
Then let's find the real Houou!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.310
Great idea!

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.640
But how?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.810
Grandpa tried for decades
but couldn't find it!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:10.690
You see, according to all the data
I've gathered so far...

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:14.910
The legend of Houou says...

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.570
What?

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:21.950
...that if you climb to the top of Bell Tower and
wave the Rainbow Feather in the wind, Houou will appear!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:26.260
Grandpa said he
tried that several times!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.480
But that it didn't work...

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.950
I see...

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:34.730
Well, anyway,
we can't just leave now.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:40.220
Let's go in!

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:03.520
This is...

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.190
Houou!

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:05.750
Yeah!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.130
Come to think of it...

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:14.980
The picture we saw at Sakuragi Institute
had a rainbow in it too, yeah?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:19.270
It did! And when I saw Houou,
there was a rainbow in the sky, too!

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:22.060
Perhaps the rainbow is the key!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:30.110
The rain clouds will
pass the Johto Region soon!

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:34.010
With a rapid shift from rain to clear skies,
and the sun low in the sky...

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.990
There's a high chance
a rainbow could appear!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:42.460
Then we wait for the rainbow
at the top of the tower, and wave the Feather?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.880
But where's the Feather?

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:47.830
Hey, Kurio!

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:49.670
Wait a second!

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.210
Pocket Monsters!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:06.470
Flying
. Normal .
Onidrill

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.100
Kurio's been a while...

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.560
Don't worry!

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:19.920
Satoshi! Go!

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.720
Will you let go of me, Kurio?

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:26.750
Just please, come with me!

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:32.990
Even if you climb the tower now,
Houou won't appear.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.250
You're wasting your time.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.590
Don't say that!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.010
For starters, you don't even
have the Rainbow Feather, do you?

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.970
Actually,

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.010
it's right here!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.600
I thought I threw it away!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.790
I kept it safe!
It's your treasure, after all!

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:53.480
C'mon, let's give it a try!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.750
Let's do it!

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.980
The rainbow won't wait!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:03.340
Oh, fine! You just want me
to come with you, right?

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:05.460
Don't get your hopes up, though.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.520
This is pretty exciting!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:14.820
Go!

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:43.060
W-W-What is this?!

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:45.900
Be careful, Grandpa!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.000
I can't get my foot loose!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.100
What's going on?!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.080
Look!

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:33.290
Weren't we
climbing the Bell Tower?!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.190
Satoshi, go check
what's going on!

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.740
Okay, leave it to me!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.790
Can you get up, Grandpa?

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.260
Come on, grab on!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.140
I'm fine.

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:03.820
You gave it your all, Kurio!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:08.160
Of course! If I falter here,
I won't get to meet Houou!

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:17.120
What is going on?!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:26.670
GPS signal not found!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:27.550
It's no use!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.670
Hoho! True Sight!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.600
We're back!

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:41.400
Look!

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.320
Odoshishi and Muma!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.860
It was all their illusions.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.470
I see!

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.510
Muma! Night Screeching Pokémon!
Ghost type!

00:14:55.510 --> 00:15:00.630
It startles people and
gathers their fear as its energy!

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:04.960
Odoshishi! Big Horn Pokémon!
Normal type!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:09.310
Staring at its antlers
creates an odd sensation!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.350
Not gonna happen!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.190
Monster Balls, go!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.080
Nice! Great!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.280
Right!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.450
I got Muma and Odoshishi!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.740
You did it!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:43.040
Muma and Odoshishi's data will be
added to the Index!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.090
Amazing, Go!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.160
That was nothing!
I'm gonna catch <i>every single</i> Pokémon!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.610
What? All of them?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:51.620
Yeah!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.580
I see light!

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:11.070
It's up there, huh?

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.690
Does this mean...?

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.460
It's fine!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.680
Here!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.100
Grab on!

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:43.560
Thank you!

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:48.570
Grandpa!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.340
The rain's stopped!

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:04.810
Now all we need is the rainbow!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:05.920
Yeah!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.050
Houou! Show yourself!

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.920
Hey! Here we are!

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:16.180
Hey!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.170
Come forth!

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.690
Houou! Show yourself!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.070
Houou!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.640
Hey! Here we are!

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:37.950
Show yourself! Hey!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:52.580
The rainbow!

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.030
All right!

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:55.550
Houou!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.800
Come forth!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:02.180
Houou!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.330
Grandpa?

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:15.500
Kurio...

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.520
Thank you.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.140
You...

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:25.660
All of you taught me!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.670
Houou!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.800
Grandpa!

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:38.660
Houou! I've come to find you!

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.750
Come forth! Show yourself!

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:43.930
Houou!

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.310
Houou!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:48.000
Hey!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.400
Show yourself!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.900
Houou!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.030
Houou! Come forth!

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:57.000
Please!

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.060
It's hopeless. Let's give up...

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.550
...for today!

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.480
Grandpa?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:18.540
I'll start searching for Houou
again tomorrow!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:21.050
Kurio, you help me, too!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:21.970
Yeah!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:49.120
All that shouting
made me hungry!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.710
Me, too!

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:53.560
Want to eat at our place, then?

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:54.790
What? Can we?!

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:58.470
My special curry
is a real masterpiece!

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.680
For real?! I really wanna try it!

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:03.950
No fair, Satoshi!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.160
Hey, children! Houou...

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.190
What about Houou?

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:44.430
Houou does exist! Right?

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:45.310
Yeah!

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.270
We told you so!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.680
Oh, Grandpa!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:53.630
Of course!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:59.860
I see... I didn't expect the sightings
to have been something like <i>that</i>!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:00.910
Yeah!

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:03.920
We couldn't meet Houou,
but we sure had fun!

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:06.320
Yeah!

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.490
I won't give up!

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:15.210
I'll catch every Pokémon,
and then Mew!

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:20.210
I won't give up on my dream of
becoming a Pokémon Master, either!

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.660
Someday, I will catch Mew!

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:26.220
I will be a Pokémon Master!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:35.000
There is no shortcut
to your dreams.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:38.830
What's important is to
keep rising to the challenge!

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:42.980
Satoshi and Go burned this lesson
into their hearts!

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:45.950
Pokémon Shiritori

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.320
Let's play Pokémon Shiritori!
Pokémon Shiritori

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.460
(Pikachu →<b> Mew Ver.)
Let's play Pokémon Shiritori!
Pokémon Shiritori</b>

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.030
Pokémon Shiritori
(Pikachu →<b> Mew Ver.)</b>

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:50.040
(Pikachu →<b> Mew Ver.)
Pokémon Shiritori</b>

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:50.290
Pokémon Shiritori
Pokémon Shiritori
(Pikachu →<b> Mew Ver.)</b>

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:51.580
Pikachu!

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:52.450
Utsubot!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.160
Transel!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:53.960
Lugia!

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:54.750
Achamo!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:55.540
Morpeko!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:56.250
Koduck!

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:57.130
Cleffy!

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:57.830
Eevee!

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:58.580
Ishitsubute!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:21:59.250
Teppouo!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.170
Onisuzume!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:00.880
Metagross!

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:01.920
Subame!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:02.590
Me...

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.840
Metamon!

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:10.140
Shiritori set to Pokémon Techno

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:13.480
Chain the names of Pokémon

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:16.480
If it ends in an 'N', you lose

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.810
Okay, let's go one more time!

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:20.110
